{
  "id": "jjwxc.net",
  "name": "晋江文学城（正版·含 VIP）",
  "pool": "正版",
  "enabled": true,
  "free_only": true,
  "predecode": false,
  "requires_js": false,
  "fetch_mode": "http",
  "demo_url": "https://www.jjwxc.net/onebook.php?novelid=6836927",
  "notes": "★ 晋江文学城，2026-09-21 实测（全哥指出该书源生态里出现最多，值得优先）。**含 VIP，只抓免费章**。\n\n【入口用**桌面版** `onebook.php?novelid={bid}`】\n  实测移动版 `m.jjwxc.net/book2/{bid}` 只给 40 条、且全是 `/vip/` 链接（拿不到免费章）；\n  桌面版 `www.jjwxc.net/onebook.php?novelid={bid}`（199 KB）里**目录完整**：\n  `table a[href*=chapterid]` → 13 条免费章（`chapterid=1..13`）。\n  → 故 `info_url` **写死 www 主机**，把 m. 的输入也归一到桌面页。\n\n【VIP 是「天然隔离」——本规则最省事的一点】\n  晋江的 VIP 章**不是 `chapterid` 链接**，而是：\n  `<a rel=\"...buynovel.php?...\" id=\"button1_14\"><font color=\"red\">[VIP]</font></a>`\n  它既没有 `chapterid=`、href 也不是章节页 → **根本进不了目录** → 一请求都不会发。\n  这比「先标 locked 再跳过」更彻底（无需 vip_child_selector）。\n  ⚠ 代价：报告里看不到「受保护 N 章」的计数（那部分从未进入目录）。\n\n【正文】章节页 `?novelid={bid}&chapterid={cid}`，正文容器 **`div.noveltext`**\n  （实测 4110 汉字；外层 `#oneboolt.chapter_columns` 4237）。\n\n【元信息】书名/作者从 `<title>` 分段取（《昭暮》臣年_晋江文学城_…）：\n  书名 `《(.+?)》`、作者取书名后到 `_` 之前那一段。\n\n【排序】chapterid 就是章节序号 → `cid_numeric_asc`。\n\n⚠ 法律：正版平台的**免费章节**。VIP 章不请求、不导出。",
  "match": [
    "jjwxc.net"
  ],
  "book": {
    "url_pattern": "novelid=(\\d+)",
    "info_url": "https://www.jjwxc.net/onebook.php?novelid={bid}",
    "title": [
      "@title"
    ],
    "title_pattern": "^《(.+?)》",
    "author": [
      "@title"
    ],
    "author_pattern": "^《[^》]+》\\s*([^_\\s]+)",
    "intro": [
      "meta[name='description']",
      "#novelintro"
    ]
  },
  "catalog": {
    "pages": {
      "mode": "single"
    },
    "item_selector": "table a[href*='chapterid=']",
    "id_from": {
      "mode": "href",
      "pattern": "chapterid=(?P<cid>\\d+)"
    },
    "url_template": "{origin}/onebook.php?novelid={bid}&chapterid={cid}",
    "sort": "cid_numeric_asc",
    "dedupe": "keep_first",
    "item_deny_text": [
      "展开全部",
      "收起"
    ]
  },
  "chapter": {
    "title_selector": "h2, .noveltitle, h1",
    "content_selector": "div.noveltext",
    "content_selectors": [
      "div.noveltext",
      "#oneboolt"
    ],
    "strip_selectors": [
      "script",
      "style",
      "#message",
      "#copyrightlist",
      "#favorite_2",
      "#invite",
      "#yrt3",
      "#report_action",
      "#favoriteshow_2",
      "#report_box",
      "#chapterJurisdiction",
      "#mongolia_layer",
      "#float_favorite",
      ".float_favorite",
      ".float_title",
      ".read_menu",
      ".comment",
      "#comment",
      "h2"
    ],
    "ad_patterns": [
      "[添加书签]",
      "[推荐本章]",
      "[举报]",
      "[投诉]",
      "晋江文学城",
      "请记住本站",
      "手机版阅读",
      "加入书架"
    ],
    "drop_leading_symbol_paragraphs": true
  }
}